   "subject": "New Shiny website launched; Shiny 0.9 released",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><i><font color=\"#999999\">Sorry, we blogged about this yesterday but I totally forgot to post it here as well. Included below is the content of the <a href=\"http://blog.rstudio.org/2014/03/27/shiny-website-and-0-9/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.rstudio.org/2014/03/27/shiny-website-and-0-9/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lBgXHfWeqX6rV50PNTyEb\">blog post</a>.</font></i><div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">We’re excited to introduce to you our new website for Shiny: <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3O-bHE3_2xyJhbSw--SyBP\">shiny.rstudio.com</a>!</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3O-bHE3_2xyJhbSw--SyBP\"><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/GTUafRGySgNWmh30aD9KHwEnEVXM_5rXcB-t-WPSkmq90fdKhIrjXHWGKIQX6_o_xNtSHIC-75lmywHBIBgEDKvm043h5WKr2YVAP19LQufOFOGqUj0IACUMuoUQ3RITfCLd=s0-d-e1-ft#http://rstudioblog.files.wordpress.com/2014/03/shiny-rstudio-com.gif?w=490&amp;h=339\" alt=\"shiny-rstudio-com\" width=\"490\" height=\"339\" style=\"border:0px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">We’ve included <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36gnj52eoMu2yHOydccDZB\">articles</a> on many Shiny-related topics, dozens of <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GVg6sB-ZBIvMEb1ki8L76\">example applications</a>, and an all-new <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cUs6SKauyCw1ZZEUhpdQG\">tutorial</a> for getting started.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">Whether you’re a beginner or expert at Shiny, we hope that having these resources available in one place will help you find the information you need.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\"><strong>We’d also like to announce Shiny 0.9, now available on CRAN.</strong> This release includes many bug fixes and new features, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:12pt;line-height:19.200000762939453px;margin:0px;border-bottom-style:none;padding:0px 0px 0.1em;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">New application layout options</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">Until now, the vast majority of Shiny apps have used a sidebar-style layout. Shiny 0.9 introduces new layout features to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em 2em;padding:0px 0px 0px 10px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px;line-height:19.200000762939453px\"><li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.25em;line-height:1.4\">\r\n\r\nMake it easy to create custom page layouts using the Bootstrap grid system. See our new <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/layout-guide.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/layout-guide.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GXXihDwHFsvHu_gYXWwfD\">application layout guide</a> or a <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/plot-plus-three-columns.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/plot-plus-three-columns.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2HXYHkdjvxki5NiJA6b4vn\">live example</a>.</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.25em;line-height:1.4\">Provide navigation bars and lists for separating your application into different pages. See <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navbarPage.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navbarPage.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QvmtMbqHl104rgnjkLAPD\">navbarPage</a> and <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navlistPanel.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navlistPanel.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sM2jsZCGn8_74lZzOAE3d\">navlistPanel</a>, and <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/navbar-example.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/navbar-example.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qHk0EL4pZ_JcKkJdMihXi\">this example</a>.</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.25em;line-height:1.4\">Enhance <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navlistPanel.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navlistPanel.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sM2jsZCGn8_74lZzOAE3d\">tabsetPanel</a> to allow pill-style tabs, and to let tabs be placed above, below, or to either side of tab content.</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.25em;line-height:1.4\">Create floating panels and place them relative to the sides of the page, optionally making them draggable. See <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/absolutePanel.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/absolutePanel.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0y9XmPmat7GWEtE0KdJ9-S\">absolutePanel</a> or <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/absolutely-positioned-panels.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/absolutely-positioned-panels.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zSha5pJhhnofSP9OQaCQp\">this example</a>.</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.25em;line-height:1.4\">Use <a href=\"https://www.google.com/webhp?ion=1&amp;espv=2&amp;ie=UTF-8#q=bootstrap+themes\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.com/webhp?ion%3D1%26espv%3D2%26ie%3DUTF-8%23q%3Dbootstrap%2Bthemes&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2rctSTKMl5E2ubw1mD3vge\">Bootstrap themes</a> to easily modify the fonts and colors of your application.<a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/retirement-simulation.html\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/retirement-simulation.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0EJVDYWZ1XiRRnua6NncCi\">Example</a></li>\r\n\r\n</ol><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">You can see many of these features in action together in <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/superzip-example.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/superzip-example.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3u0wpzIXZHRTOhUo7Wn6a3\">our reimplementation</a> of the Washington Post’s <a href=\"http://www.washingtonpost.com/sf/local/2013/11/09/washington-a-world-apart/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.washingtonpost.com/sf/local/2013/11/09/washington-a-world-apart/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2h8puwhReACA6o_Gdmk23S\">interactive article on Super Zips</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:12pt;line-height:19.200000762939453px;margin:0px;border-bottom-style:none;padding:0px 0px 0.1em;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Selectize.js integration</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">The JavaScript library <a href=\"https://github.com/brianreavis/selectize.js\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/brianreavis/selectize.js&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hTKENxTlyuhKRvkumSmK5\">selectize.js</a> provides a much more flexible interface compared to the basic select input. It allows you to type and search in the options, use placeholders, control the number of options/items to show/select, and so on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/uwysJJ2dvSzJPGkOUMq1NuTS1nCCDESCXnP2PkX9Ysi6YQ7YtWsHi_0Al2vGVgdAqD39nKra2P62jjI0bveIh68iNlZr3-3onf7BRDz-qB0X4gVm3h8fq6PnBw=s0-d-e1-ft#http://rstudioblog.files.wordpress.com/2014/03/selectize.png?w=308&amp;h=187\" alt=\"selectize\" width=\"308\" height=\"187\" style=\"border:0px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">We have integrated selectize.js in shiny 0.9, and <code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">selectInput</code> now creates selectize inputs by default. (You can revert back to plain select inputs by passing<code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">selectize=FALSE</code> to <code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">selectInput</code>.) For more advanced uses, we have included a new <code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">selectizeInput</code> function that lets you pass options to selectize.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">Please check out <a href=\"https://demo.shinyapps.io/013-selectize/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://demo.shinyapps.io/013-selectize/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3DXx9tVJaLrkiwN8---8QX\">this example</a> to see a subset of features of the selectize input. There is also <a href=\"https://demo.shinyapps.io/017-select-vs-selectize/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://demo.shinyapps.io/017-select-vs-selectize/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RlASRJHQL25qaKH6gmbgY\">an example</a> comparing the select and selectize input.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:12pt;line-height:19.200000762939453px;margin:0px;border-bottom-style:none;padding:0px 0px 0.1em;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">Showcase mode</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">Shiny apps can now (optionally) run in a “showcase” mode in which the app’s R code can be automatically displayed within the app. Most of the Shiny example apps in our new<a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GVg6sB-ZBIvMEb1ki8L76\">gallery</a> use showcase mode.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/kmeans-example.html\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/kmeans-example.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3StvtBcuJfDyvdrVaIlTWN\"><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/dD70fDOpnn8H_iOEYhfXyyQBtx4_3R96Ms39WfMe3xM691P5UHQfSdYcoTTbLoz3rsFssjl9DwqKwqKiNZyEaEBFmu2arApuJAX8rMNsCK2kZA=s0-d-e1-ft#http://rstudioblog.files.wordpress.com/2014/03/kmeans.png?w=490\" alt=\"Showcase example\" style=\"border:0px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">As you interact with the application, reactive expressions and outputs in server.R will light up as they execute. This can be helpful in visualizing the reactivity in your app.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">See <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/display-modes.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/display-modes.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1iHtTNUDjnqlZ450jQElhM\">this article</a> to learn more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">As always, you can install the latest release of Shiny by running this command at the R console:</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">install.packages(&quot;shiny&quot;)</code></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">The complete list of bug fixes and features is available in the <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/shiny/NEWS\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(33,65,178);font-size:10pt;border-bottom-style:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/shiny/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404216184000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RNTIqsoBK-rVyKFbc1Mdi\">NEWS file</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em;line-height:1.4;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px\">We hope you’ll find these new features helpful in exploring and understanding your data!</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"clear:both;padding-top:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Tahoma,Helvetica;font-size:13px;line-height:19.200000762939453px\"><div style=\"clear:both\">\r\n\r\n</div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
